E204                  (    forth6809.asm):03044         TNDOUBLE:                           ; U currently holds [UDLO(bottom), UDHI(top)], matching
                      (    forth6809.asm):03045                                             ; ANS's (ud1) stack order directly.
E204 DC00             (    forth6809.asm):03046                     LDD   STATE
