                      (    forth6809.asm):05495         ; Common part of */ and */MOD: form the 32-bit product n1 * n2, then
                      (    forth6809.asm):05496         ; divide it by n3. The quotient is negated if an odd number of the
                      (    forth6809.asm):05497         ; three is negative, the remainder if the product is negative. THROW
                      (    forth6809.asm):05498         ; -10 if n3 is zero.
